.SS "\fBHash32\fP SystemEx\&.Hash\&.CRC32\&.Compute (FixedVector< byte > input, uint seed)"

.PP
Computes a CRC‑32 checksum over the specified input buffer\&. If a non‑zero seed is provided, the computation is performed as a one‑shot operation\&. If the seed is zero, the computation continues from the internal rolling CRC‑32 state\&. This design allows CRC‑32 to operate in both streaming (rolling) and one‑shot modes without modifying the \fBIHash\fP pipeline\&. 
.PP
Implements \fBSystemEx\&.Hash\&.IHash\fP\&.
